{
    "title": "MyPerfectResume Builder",
    "description": "No more time wasted on guessing what to put in your resume. The My Perfect Resume Builder includes dozens of resume templates with thousands of job-specific bullet points for you to customize. It doesn't matter if you're new to the job market or a veteran\u2014we can help craft a resume that reflects your experience level and field.\r\n\r\nGET EXPERT GUIDANCE EVERY STEP OF THE WAY\r\nStand out from the crowd and make sure recruiters and employers take notice with guidance from our experts that is backed by research. From start to finish, we will show you how to make a resume, by recommending the best resume format for your work experience, and providing professional advice to emphasize your strengths and accomplishments. My Perfect Resume will help you feel confident during your job-seeking process.\r\n\r\nCREATE A NEW RESUME OR IMPORT YOUR OWN\r\nOur simple technology allows you to upload and reformat your existing resume or start from scratch. We\u2019ll cover everything from your education, to your work history, skills, and more. \r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD & SHARE IN MULTIPLE FORMATS\r\nYou can download, print and share your resume in your preferred format and access it from your mobile device or computer by searching MyPerfectResume.com. Feel at ease knowing you can apply for jobs anytime, anywhere.\r\nMAKE AN ATS-FRIENDLY IMPRESSION\r\nMany companies rely on Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) to manage large amounts of resumes they receive. ATS scans your resume, compares the requirements for each job and decides on a score for you. This helps recruiters speed up their selection process. My Perfect Resume offers customizable resume templates that are designed to pass through ATS.",
    "descriptionHTML": "No more time wasted on guessing what to put in your resume. The My Perfect Resume Builder includes dozens of resume templates with thousands of job-specific bullet points for you to customize. It doesn&#39;t matter if you&#39;re new to the job market or a veteran\u2014we can help craft a resume that reflects your experience level and field.<br><br>GET EXPERT GUIDANCE EVERY STEP OF THE WAY<br>Stand out from the crowd and make sure recruiters and employers take notice with guidance from our experts that is backed by research. From start to finish, we will show you how to make a resume, by recommending the best resume format for your work experience, and providing professional advice to emphasize your strengths and accomplishments. My Perfect Resume will help you feel confident during your job-seeking process.<br><br>CREATE A NEW RESUME OR IMPORT YOUR OWN<br>Our simple technology allows you to upload and reformat your existing resume or start from scratch. We\u2019ll cover everything from your education, to your work history, skills, and more. <br><br>DOWNLOAD &amp; SHARE IN MULTIPLE FORMATS<br>You can download, print and share your resume in your preferred format and access it from your mobile device or computer by searching MyPerfectResume.com. Feel at ease knowing you can apply for jobs anytime, anywhere.<br>MAKE AN ATS-FRIENDLY IMPRESSION<br>Many companies rely on Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) to manage large amounts of resumes they receive. ATS scans your resume, compares the requirements for each job and decides on a score for you. This helps recruiters speed up their selection process. My Perfect Resume offers customizable resume templates that are designed to pass through ATS.",
